@startuml AIC_Dual_Call_Sequence
title 《天台十句》AIC 一轮交互时序图

autonumber "<b>[000]"

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #334155
  LifeLineBorderColor #64748B
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  ParticipantBorderColor #334155
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
  ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
  ActorBorderColor #334155
  ActorBackgroundColor #E0F2FE
  BoxBorderColor #64748B
  BoxBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

actor "玩家" as Player
participant "GameView" as View
participant "gameStore" as Store
participant "LLMService" as Client
participant "Gin Chat Handler" as Handler
participant "角色生成 LLM" as Role
participant "独立裁判 LLM" as Judge
participant "规则守门" as Gate
participant "前端状态机" as State

Player -> View : 输入自由语言
View -> Store : sendMessage(userMessage)
Store -> Store : 记录本句\nroundCount -= 1
Store -> Client : POST /api/chat\n历史 + 状态 + 本句
Client -> Handler : HTTP 请求

activate Handler
Handler -> Role : system Prompt\n角色事实 + 安全边界
Role --> Handler : 自然对白 assistant_reply
Handler -> Judge : system Prompt + payload\n历史、本句、assistant_reply、状态
Judge --> Handler : JSON evaluation\nemotion / ai_state / trust / pressure / ending
Handler -> Gate : normalizeEvaluation()
activate Gate
Gate -> Gate : 先扣 pressure_delta\n再加 trust_delta
Gate -> Gate : 校验 trust=15、离开动作、机会耗尽
Gate --> Handler : 确定性 ChatResponse
deactivate Gate
Handler --> Client : reply + evaluation
deactivate Handler

Client -> State : normalize response
State -> State : 更新信任、姿态、情绪\n必要时拦截低信任结局
State --> View : 对白、状态、结局演出

opt 请求方向提示
  Player -> View : 点击“寻找线索”
  View -> Client : POST /api/hint
  Client -> Handler : history
  Handler -> Judge : PFA + MI/OARS hint Prompt
  Judge --> Handler : 20 字以内方向
  Handler --> Client : hint
  Client --> View : 显示提示
end

opt 结局后的心理沟通复盘
  State -> Client : POST /api/ending-summary
  Client -> Handler : 完整对话 + ending_type + 统计
  Handler -> Judge : 复盘 Prompt\n可观察行为 rubric
  Judge --> Handler : turning_line +\npsychological_reading + skills + boundary
  Handler --> Client : EndingSummaryResponse
  Client --> View : AI × 心理健康沟通复盘卡片
end

note over Role,Judge
两次调用是“生成 / 评价”的职责拆分。
它提升可审计性与程序可控性，
但不构成两个模型独立验证真相。
end note

@enduml

